Steps to get changes made in file in own branch to main branch using VS Code Terminal:
1) Save own work on own branch: git add 
    then: git commit -m "your message"
2) Switch to main branch: git checkout main
3) get latest changes to main branch: git pull origin main
4) merge branch with main on own laptop: git merge <your-branch-name>
5) update main to github: git push origin main
